==============================================================================
WEBRTC ENGINE (PION, GO / WEBASSEMBLY)
==============================================================================
Built from native/webrtc-engine with go1.26.3; module versions are pinned by go.sum (SHA-256 e2376d68b68c4f3efe2173aab0759511b2eeba7e93f6e56d787e91b25bd4781e).
Embedded module SHA-256: b85f97ae1eff3f159f81287fd0366c02bce091b8f9f3d902b06abbc0f0e7bf9d. Rebuild it with \`node scripts/build-webrtc.mjs\` (Go is required for that step only).
Pion is built from a patched copy of github.com/pion/webrtc/v4 in which the upstream wrapper around the browser's own RTCPeerConnection is removed and the "!js" build constraints on the native stack are dropped (see scripts/build-webrtc.mjs). The unmodified upstream license applies to the modified files.


